## Interface: 16001, 16002, 16003, 16100, 16101, 16200
## Title: My Gamepad Is Rich
## Notes: Extra buttons of your controller (back paddles, extra triggers: GameSir, Xbox Elite, DualSense Edge, SCUF, 8BitDo, Flydigi...): hold modifiers with A/B/X/Y/D-pad, or simple buttons with LT/RT layers.
## Notes-frFR: Boutons supplémentaires de ta manette (palettes arrière, gâchettes en plus : GameSir, Xbox Elite, DualSense Edge, SCUF, 8BitDo, Flydigi...) : modificateurs maintenus avec A/B/X/Y/croix, ou boutons simples avec couches LT/RT.
## Notes-deDE: Zusatztasten deines Controllers (Rückseiten-Paddel, zusätzliche Trigger: GameSir, Xbox Elite, DualSense Edge, SCUF, 8BitDo, Flydigi...): gehaltene Modifikatoren mit A/B/X/Y/Steuerkreuz oder einfache Tasten mit LT/RT-Ebenen.
## Notes-esES: Botones adicionales de tu mando (paletas traseras, gatillos extra: GameSir, Xbox Elite, DualSense Edge, SCUF, 8BitDo, Flydigi...): modificadores con A/B/X/Y/cruceta o botones simples con capas LT/RT.
## Notes-esMX: Botones adicionales de tu control (paletas traseras, gatillos extra: GameSir, Xbox Elite, DualSense Edge, SCUF, 8BitDo, Flydigi...): modificadores con A/B/X/Y/cruceta o botones simples con capas LT/RT.
## Notes-itIT: Pulsanti aggiuntivi del tuo controller (palette posteriori, grilletti extra: GameSir, Xbox Elite, DualSense Edge, SCUF, 8BitDo, Flydigi...): modificatori con A/B/X/Y/croce o pulsanti semplici con strati LT/RT.
## Notes-ptBR: Botões extras do seu controle (paddles traseiros, gatilhos extras: GameSir, Xbox Elite, DualSense Edge, SCUF, 8BitDo, Flydigi...): modificadores com A/B/X/Y/direcional ou botões simples com camadas LT/RT.
## Notes-ruRU: Дополнительные кнопки вашего геймпада (задние лепестки, доп. курки: GameSir, Xbox Elite, DualSense Edge, SCUF, 8BitDo, Flydigi...): модификаторы с A/B/X/Y/крестовиной или простые кнопки со слоями LT/RT.
## Notes-koKR: 컨트롤러의 추가 버튼(후면 패들, 추가 트리거: GameSir, Xbox Elite, DualSense Edge, SCUF, 8BitDo, Flydigi...): A/B/X/Y/십자키와 쓰는 수정키 또는 LT/RT 층이 있는 단일 버튼.
## Notes-zhCN: 手柄的额外按键（背键、额外扳机：GameSir、Xbox Elite、DualSense Edge、SCUF、8BitDo、飞智…）：配合 A/B/X/Y/十字键的修饰键，或带 LT/RT 层的普通按键。
## Notes-zhTW: 手把的額外按鍵（背鍵、額外扳機：GameSir、Xbox Elite、DualSense Edge、SCUF、8BitDo、飛智…）：搭配 A/B/X/Y/十字鍵的修飾鍵，或帶 LT/RT 層的一般按鍵。
